flowchart TD
    A[User searches for artist or song] --> B[Catalog search\nreturns matching tracks]
    B --> C[User picks a seed track]
    C --> D[Build weighted audio vector\nfrom sidebar feature weights]
    D --> E[Cosine similarity\nvs entire catalog]
    E --> F[Top 2k audio-similar candidates]
    F --> G{Last.fm cache\navailable?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Compute Jaccard tag similarity\nseed artist vs candidate artist]
    G -- No --> I[tag_score = None]
    H --> J{Candidate artist in\nseed's similar-artists list?}
    I --> J
    J -- Yes --> K[lastfm_bonus = +0.05]
    J -- No --> L[lastfm_bonus = 0.0]
    K --> M[Blended score\naudio*w_audio + tag*w_tag + bonus]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Sort by blended score,\ntake top k]
    N --> O[Rate confidence per result\nhigh / medium / low]
    O --> P{Google API key\navailable?}
    P -- Yes --> Q[Gemini generates explanation\nfor top 5 results]
    P -- No --> R[Results rendered without explanation]
    Q --> S[Render results with\nscores, tags, radar chart, explanation]
    R --> S
